#undef NDEBUG
// Review HJ: /api/analyze-behavior's correlation miner keyed by a typed
// attribute or column, and alignments of nets mined under such keys.
//
// - pm4py's correlation variants on the route's inputs read the upload's
//   frame (read_xes' DataFrame, format_dataframe's of a CSV) and
//   convert_to_event_log of it, so every adapter reads the frame's cells
//   (pandas' dtypes: an int column beside a gap float64, dates UTC
//   Timestamps, a gap NaN, NaT or None), not read_xes' legacy objects; the
//   log and stream adapters walk the EventLog (classic_split keeps the
//   gaps), the frame adapters the DataFrame (classic_split drops their
//   rows); a key without a column is a KeyError ("['K'] not in index" on a
//   frame). pandas types an int column past INT64_MAX beside a negative int
//   as object only when both come before its first None.
// - /api/align's moves name a blank label '' (a log or synchronous move),
//   and a transition labelled None (mined under a key with a valueless
//   value) is silent; the less-memory search prices it 1 in a trace holding
//   None.
//
// Expected values are pm4py 2.7.22 black-box on the same inputs
// (review-harness round-hj: tc/mkhj.py, ct/cs2.py, ct/al.py).
//
// Usage: minera_server_review_hj_tests <minera_server>
